#: trelby/trelbyctrl.py:538
msgid ""
"This script has Chinese, Japanese or Korean characters, which are\n"
"twice as wide as Latin letters, so they don't fit in the columns\n"
"of the page.\n"
"\n"
"Switch the script to double-width characters? Every character,\n"
"Latin ones too, will then take up two columns.\n"
"\n"
"This clears the undo history. It can be changed back in\n"
"Script/Script settings/Formatting."
msgstr ""
"此剧本包含中文、日文或韩文字符，这些字符的宽度\n"
"是拉丁字母的两倍，因此无法对齐页面的列。\n"
"\n"
"是否将此剧本切换为双宽字符？切换后，所有字符\n"
"（包括拉丁字母）都将占用两列。\n"
"\n"
"此操作会清除撤销历史。之后可以在\n"
"“剧本/剧本设置/格式”中改回。"

